  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-001001, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-001002, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-001021, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-001101, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-002001, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-002002, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-002203. BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-002004, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003001, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003002, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003101, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003201, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003202, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003203, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003204, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003205, BSB-ARP-ZZ-00-DR-A-003206,  Design & Access Statement  received 4 June 2021; Cycle Access Note, Lighting Design Criteria received 25 June 2021) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the Gatehouse hereby approved shall match those specified in the approved plans and Design & Access Statement.",
    "Condition : 4 - Notwithstanding the approved plans, the access doorway to the gatehouse shall have: a minimum clear width of 900mm; a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor; and a door handle set no more than 1 metre above ground level.",
    "Condition : 5 - No development shall commence until a scheme setting out the type, design, illumination levels, product specifications and measures to control glare and overspill light from the exterior lighting on the gatehouse and measures to ensure exterior lighting is  switched off when not in use has been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details."
